## ✨ Features

### 🔍 Core Features

- **Multi-Layer Verification System**
  - ML-powered Fake/Real classification using Logistic Regression
  - AI-generated summaries using Gemini API
  - Real-time verification via NewsAPI
  - Combined credibility scoring (0-100 scale)

- **Google OAuth 2.0 Authentication**
  - Secure login via Google Identity Services
  - JWT token-based sessions (24-hour expiration)
  - HTTP-only secure cookies (XSS protection)
  - User profile management

- **Guest Access with Limits**
  - 3 free analyses per session
  - No account required
  - localStorage-based tracking
  - Encourages registration for unlimited access

- **Analysis Caching**
  - Instant results for repeated queries
  - Reduced API costs
  - Cache indicators on UI
  - Configurable cache strategy

- **Comprehensive History & Analytics**
  - User-specific analysis history
  - Analytics dashboard with metrics:
    - Total analyses
    - Fake vs. Real count
    - Average credibility scores
  - Pagination support (8 items per page)
  - Guest history via localStorage

- **Advanced Credibility Assessment**
  - 0-100 scale credibility score
  - Risk level indicators (Low/Moderate/High)
  - Manipulation risk assessment
  - Category-based analysis (Politics, Health, Science, Economy, Other)
  - Confidence percentages

- **Responsive Design**
  - Mobile-first responsive layout
  - Dark mode support
  - Glass morphism UI components
  - Tailwind CSS styling
  - Accessibility considerations

