## 🗄️ Database Design

### Database Name
```
fake_news_db
```

### Main Table: `news_checks`

| Column | Type | Constraint | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT | PRIMARY KEY, AUTO_INCREMENT | Unique identifier |
| `news_text` | TEXT | NOT NULL | Original news text |
| `prediction` | ENUM('Fake', 'Real') | DEFAULT NULL | ML prediction |
| `confidence` | FLOAT | DEFAULT NULL | Confidence score (0-1) |
| `api_verification` | VARCHAR(255) | DEFAULT 'Pending' | Credibility status |
| `created_at` | TIMESTAMP | DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | Creation time |
| `ai_summary` | TEXT | DEFAULT NULL | AI-generated summary |
| `credibility_score` | INT | DEFAULT 50 | Overall score (0-100) |
| `claim_category` | VARCHAR(50) | DEFAULT 'Other' | Category label |

### Indexes
```sql
PRIMARY KEY: id (auto-increment)
INDEX: idx_news_text (255 char prefix for searching)
```

### Sample Data Categories
- Political news
- Health claims
- Science & Technology
- Economic news
- Space exploration

